-- Every point where the mod touches Far Far West (UE 5.8, UE4SS experimental with the official Far Far West signature config). Far Far West's UE4SS config turns off ProcessEvent and Actor tick hooks, so the mod polls on a game-thread timer instead of hooking. verified = in_game once seen working in the running game.
